{"suttaId":"tha-ap437","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[674,691],"vripara":"44"},"segments":{"tha-ap437:0.3":"Ucchukhaṇḍikattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap437:1.1":"“Nagare bandhumatiyā, dvārapālo ahosahaṃ;","tha-ap437:1.3":"Addasaṃ virajaṃ buddhaṃ, sabbadhammāna pāraguṃ.","tha-ap437:2.1":"“Ucchukhaṇḍikamādāya, buddhaseṭṭhassadāsahaṃ;","tha-ap437:2.3":"Pasannacitto sumano, vipassissa mahesino.","tha-ap437:3.1":"“Ekanavutito kappe, yaṃ ucchumadadiṃ tadā;","tha-ap437:3.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, ucchukhaṇḍassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap437:4.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap437:5.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap437:6.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap437:7.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā ucchukhaṇḍiko thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap437:8.1":"Ucchukhaṇḍikattherassāpadānaṃ pañcamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
